#15=IFCAUDIOVISUALAPPLIANCE('0f5uS8$ijIFeKLmkRGLmJi',#5,'A.I.R Liberator','The A.I.R Liberator is a multipattern tube condenser with a transformer coupled output. It uses a 2-stage circuit that uses both triodes in the 12AX7 tube; its transformer ratio is approximately 10:1.\X2\000A\X0\The capsule is a 32mm K67 type, as can be found in most low-cost microphones.\X2\000A\X0\External switches provide independent high-pass filter and pad capabilities.\X2\000A\X0\The Liberator is internally identical to that of the Avantone CV-12, although the CV-12 has metal switches rather than plastic. Both of these mi','Multi-Pattern Condenser Microphone',#12,$,'Liberator',.MICROPHONE.);
